OL,3,GNEWSAInjured walker rescued in 12-hour
OL,4,Aoperation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA walker with injuries to his head,
OL,7,Farms, back and legs has been rescued
OL,8,Fafter a 12-hour operation by mountain
OL,9,Frescue teams.
OL,11,FWasdale Mountain Rescue Team was called
OL,12,Fto Red Ghyll, in the Lord's Rake area
OL,13,Fof the Lake District, after reports of
OL,14,Fsomeone shouting in the area at 20:49
OL,15,FBST on Tuesday.
OL,17,FA 43-year-old man had strayed from the
OL,18,FLord's Rake path and ended up 150m
OL,19,F(492ft) below it with a number of
OL,20,Finjuries, rescuers said.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
