OL,3,GNEWSAInjured walker rescued in 12-hour
OL,4,Aoperation
OL,5,
OL,6,FTeam leader Lee Johnson said the
OL,7,Fconditions on the fell were "brutal"
OL,8,Fand his group could not have carried
OL,9,Fout the rescue without the help of
OL,10,Fnearby mountain rescue teams.
